{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>SubRadar 是一款專為管理訂閱服務而設的智能工具，協助用戶集中檢視所有月費項目，避免因遺忘而產生不必要開支。適合需要精打細算、希望掌握個人財務流向的用戶，目前提供限時免費下載機會。</p>\n\n<h2>全自動追蹤與提醒</h2>\n<p>應用支援十種貨幣，可自動計算每月及每年總支出，並透過清晰品牌圖標快速辨識清單。其核心功能在於預警機制：於續費前三天及前一天發送通知，同時針對免費試用期設置倒數計時，防止意外扣款。數據完全存於本地裝置，無需註冊帳號或授權銀行資訊，確保隱私安全且支援離線使用，讓用戶輕鬆掌控每一筆訂閱費用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-202-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-203-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-204-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-205-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-206-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：SubRadar: Track Subscriptions</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-10T00:51:30.344811+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}